From: SAT-IP appliance contributors
Subject: [PATCH] mpegts: optional bounded idle mux grace for exclusive handover

Retain an idle mux without a dummy/overlapping playback subscription.
Reusing the active mux cancels the timer; forced stops bypass the grace.
SAT-IP defaults to 1000 ms after stable appliance testing, bounded to two
seconds. Saved zero values disable retention; other input types stay unchanged.
Upstream-Status: Pending

